  {
    "screen": "steam-millennium-config-backup-scheduled-snapshot-guardian-and-clean-restore-boundary-04",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "日常让 AI 运行 tools/Invoke-MillenniumBackup.ps1 -Mode Status -Json 查状态，或直接看驾驶舱；要马上存一份用 -Mode Snapshot，自查周任务用 tools/Manage-MillenniumTask.ps1 -Mode Inspect -Json。恢复先用 -Mode RestorePlan 选版本。开始菜单里的“备份状态”入口已在 9 月 26 日撤下，原来的状态窗口脚本仍可以直接运行。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **先看快照真的留到了哪里**　周任务或手动采集分别报告本地结果与独立副本；提交到版本库和冷备是另外的证据。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
